WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:06.609
Temple Treasure is a push-your-luck game for two to eight players. How deep are you willing to go?

2
00:00:07.309 --> 00:00:11.934
Everyone starts inside the temple, and a card is revealed on every step.

3
00:00:12.085 --> 00:00:18.826
Treasure cards get shared out equally among whoever is still inside, and anything left over stays on the path.

4
00:00:19.527 --> 00:00:31.156
Hazards are harmless the first time you see them. But when the second card of the same hazard turns up, everyone still inside loses everything they're carrying, and the expedition is over.

5
00:00:31.856 --> 00:00:36.819
After each card, you secretly choose. Keep exploring, or head back to camp.

6
00:00:36.969 --> 00:00:46.197
Go back, and your treasure is safe, plus you grab a share of what's left on the path. If you're the only one who leaves, you also take any artifacts.

7
00:00:46.897 --> 00:00:53.069
Most treasure after all the expeditions wins. Keep an eye on which hazards you've already seen once.
